<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

The module finds carrier files and reads ownership titles from disk. `disk-projector.ts` calls its exports and re-exports them for existing callers. Node filesystem and projector dependencies keep this compiled module outside the meme graph; its source window names the code-file seat. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

